1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,960
Umuulan. May silbi
pa ba ang solar mo?

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:06,080
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:08,520
Oo, pero mas
mahina ang output.

4
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:12,560
Kapag maulap, nababawasan
ang liwanag sa panels.

5
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:16,350
Kaya bumababa ang output,
minsan malaki ang bawas.

6
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:20,120
Pero madalas hindi zero, dahil
may diffuse light pa rin.

7
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:25,930
Ang tamang tingin: kWh sa
buong buwan, hindi isang araw.

8
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:31,810
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

9
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:33,570
Life is SoLight with Solar.
